OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warning in place ahead of
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong winds of up to 75mph could cause
OL,7,Fdisruption across parts of Northern
OL,8,FIreland this weekend as Storm Boelo
OL,9,Fmoves in.
OL,11,FA Met Office weather warning has been
OL,12,Fissued from 18:00 BST on Saturday until
OL,13,F15:00 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FMeanwhile, Irish weather service Met
OL,16,FEireann has issued a series of orange
OL,17,Fand yellow warnings for heavy rain and
OL,18,Fdamaging winds across parts of the
OL,19,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
