OL,3,GNEWSAWeather warning in place ahead of
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong westerly winds are expected to
OL,7,Fbecome widespread on Saturday evening,
OL,8,Fwith very windy conditions continuing
OL,9,Fovernight and through much of Sunday.
